# Vercel CLI's local project link + pulled env — machine-specific, never shared.
.vercel/
# The bundled function scripts/build-api.mjs produces from api/_src/handler.ts. Generated on
# every deploy by vercel.json's installCommand; committing it would let it drift from the
# source it's built from, which is exactly the stale-build-artifact failure mode this repo
# already learned from once (see tsconfig.json's note on the same subject).
api/handler.mjs
